                                "sense_id": "01c5db58-39e7-3a53-a3ff-5fbef42c7283",
                                "text": "We often have no panadol, no bandages. Only one nurse said she had noticed an improvement in drug supply since mid-1993."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4a7b70b-2386-403a-8aa7-7ed401bedb61",
                                "sense_id": "01c5db58-39e7-3a53-a3ff-5fbef42c7283",
                                "text": "When I rang my doctor, he said, \"Take some panadol and see me in the morning.\" When I told him that I had no panadol or any other type of painkillers in the house he was surprised."
                            },
